# Mako has no [global] section: the keys at the top of the file ARE the
# defaults, and a [section] header starts a per-app criteria block. Writing
# "[global]" here is a parse error ("Invalid boolean criteria field 'global'")
# and mako exits - which silently costs the whole notification system.
#
# Every option here is one that mako 1.x still knows. "position" was renamed
# to "anchor" (top-right is the default anyway) and border-radius takes a
# DIRECTION, not pixels; an option this version does not know is a parse
# error that kills mako outright, so the version-dependent ones are left out.
#
# Translucent, so the blurred wallpaper (shani-sway-blur) reads through the
# popup. Mako takes its colours as #RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA.
background-color=#1a1b26cc
text-color=#c0caf5
border-color=#7aa2f780
border-size=2
default-timeout=5000
max-visible=5